`\n\nThe key observation is that while I\'ve identified the specific changes needed in activity_tracker.py, I cannot directly modify the file. This requires delegating to a code writing agent or seeking permissions to modify code.\n\nWould you like me to request specific permissions or spawn a code writing agent to complete the implementation?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Good progress! You reported status='in_progress' and phase='implementation_planning'. Please continue with the next step. Use the appropriate tools to proceed with implementation. Do not stop until all milestones are complete and status='success' with phase='complete'."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01SetomzwZcTKXbWWoD6p2Cz', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': '2136bcc1', 'description': 'Create implementation plan for Agent Completion Summary Visibility', 'assigned_to': 'executive_director'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01SetomzwZcTKXbWWoD6p2Cz', 'content': '{"success": true, "task_id": "5f9bee2a", "message": "Added task: Create implementation plan for Agent Completion Summary Visibility"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01DVqKbbwsRU5hYXEhpKdq6L', 'name': 'git_branch', 'input': {'action': 'create', 'branch_name': 'feature/agent-completion-summary-visibility'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01DVqKbbwsRU5hYXEhpKdq6L', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Created and switched to branch \'feature/agent-completion-summary-visibility\'", "branch": "feature/agent-completion-summary-visibility", "from_branch": null}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01FWTPLLix3hDgjAVpsLRDbk', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/agent_completion_summary_implementation_pla