r key, value in response_data.items() \n            if key not in [\'needs_clarification\', \'status\', \'user_question\', \'clarification_question\', \'options\']\n        }\n    }\n\n    return {\n        "needs_clarification": needs_clarification,\n        "needs_user_input": needs_user_input,\n        "question_metadata": question_metadata\n    }\n```\n\n## Integration Considerations\n- Method to be integrated into existing `AgentRuntime.execute()` method\n- Use `activity_tracker` to record question events\n- Support seamless pause and resume of agent execution\n\n## Recommended Next Steps\n1. Code Review\n2. Unit Testing\n3. Integration Testing\n4. Documentation Update\n\n## Potential Challenges\n- Ensuring backwards compatibility\n- Handling various response formats\n- Maintaining performance overhead\n\n## Decision Tracking\n- Strategy approved: [Date]\n- Planned implementation branch: feature/question-detection-implementation'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01NpntsgNUFZf2qz31ekuzi3', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/question_detection_strategy.md", "backup_path": null, "was_overwrite": false}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': "You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\n\n\n## Instructions\n\n\n## Input Format\nYour input will be provided in the following format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## Output Format\nYou must respond with JSON matching this exact format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## When to Request Clarification\nRequest clarification when:\n\n\n## Termination Conditions\nYou are done when:\n\n\nCRITICAL: Your response must be valid JSON matching the Output Format exactly.\n\n## Your Performance History\n- Success rate: 53.2%\n- Average iterations per task: 12.3\n- Common errors to avoid: CircuitBreakerOpenError, BadRequestError, RateLimitError\n\n**Tips for this run:**\n- Focus on completin