 Data Flow\\n1. **Current**: Agent \\u2192 `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/` \\u2192 Files stored in nested location\\n2. **Target**: Agent \\u2192 `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/output/` \\u2192 Files stored at root level\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n- Git repository for version control\\n- File system permissions for directory creation/modification\\n- Agent configuration system access\\n\\n## Risk Mitigation\\n- Use git mv to preserve file history\\n- Backup verification before old directory removal\\n- Incremental validation throughout migration\\n- Test agent functionality before finalization\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- All files successfully migrated to new location\\n- Agent configurations updated and functional\\n- No broken references or missing files\\n- User can access outputs easily at root level"}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929', 'system': "You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\n\n\n## Instructions\n\n\n## Input Format\nYour input will be provided in the following format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## Output Format\nYou must respond with JSON matching this exact format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## When to Request Clarification\nRequest clarification when:\n\n\n## Termination Conditions\nYou are done when:\n\n\nCRITICAL: Your response must be valid JSON matching the Output Format exactly.\n\n## Your Performance History\n- Success rate: 53.2%\n- Average iterations per task: 12.3\n- Common errors to avoid: CircuitBreakerOpenError, BadRequestError, RateLimitError\n\n**Tips for this run:**\n- Focus on completing tasks successfully - your success rate needs improvement.\n- Try to be more efficient - you're using more iterations than typical.\n- Watch out for these common errors: CircuitBreakerOpenError, BadRequestError\n\n**Learnings from your recent runs:**\n- I decisively identified the correct file, made the specific change requested, and followed up with git commit and project tracking. The process was completed efficientl