r key, value in response_data.items() \n            if key not in [\'needs_clarification\', \'status\', \'user_question\', \'clarification_question\', \'options\']\n        }\n    }\n\n    return {\n        "needs_clarification": needs_clarification,\n        "needs_user_input": needs_user_input,\n        "question_metadata": question_metadata\n    }\n```\n\n## Integration Considerations\n- Method to be integrated into existing `AgentRuntime.execute()` method\n- Use `activity_tracker` to record question events\n- Support seamless pause and resume of agent execution\n\n## Recommended Next Steps\n1. Code Review\n2. Unit Testing\n3. Integration Testing\n4. Documentation Update\n\n## Potential Challenges\n- Ensuring backwards compatibility\n- Handling various response formats\n- Maintaining performance overhead\n\n## Decision Tracking\n- Strategy approved: [Date]\n- Planned implementation branch: feature/question-detection-implementation'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01NpntsgNUFZf2qz31ekuzi3', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/question_detection_strategy.md", "backup_path": null, "was_overwrite": false}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01LtZFzk9f3gF14DR6BxnNHG', 'name': 'git_commit', 'input': {'message': 'Add question detection implementation strategy documentation', 'files': ['docs/question_detection_strategy.md']}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01LtZFzk9f3gF14DR6BxnNHG', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Changes committed successfully", "commit_hash": "40f6cd5953e30f0fe7c252ab7e2bb1a00afa04da", "files": ["docs/question_detection_strategy.md"], "commit_output": "[feature/task-decomposition-engine 40f6cd5] Add question detection implementation strategy documentation\\n 1 file changed, 72 insertions(+)\\n create mode 100644 docs/qu