rs/strings\\n\\n**Performance**:\\n- No N+1 query patterns\\n- Appropriate data structures\\n- No unnecessary loops\\n\\n### Severity Levels\\n\\n**Critical**: Security vulnerabilities, data loss risks, crashes\\n**High**: Logic errors, performance problems, missing error handling\\n**Medium**: Code duplication, unclear naming, missing comments\\n**Low**: Style inconsistencies, minor refactoring\\n**Suggestion**: Alternative approaches, future improvements\\n\\n### When to Approve\\n- No critical/high severity issues\\n- Tests pass and cover key scenarios\\n- Security basics in place\\n\\n### When to Request Changes\\n- Any critical issues found\\n- Multiple high severity issues\\n- Security vulnerabilities present\\n\\n## Clarification Conditions\\n- Uncertainty about project standards\\n- Unable to determine if change is intentional\\n\\n## Model Preference\\nsonnet\\n\\n## Max Iterations\\n10\\n\\n## Can Write Code\\nfalse\\n\\n## Task Complexity\\ncreative\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_015KAza4yQYBnVSLiBfBSFhM', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': '31930de9', 'description': 'Design strategy to implement _detect_question method without direct code modification', 'assigned_to': 'executive_director'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_015KAza4yQYBnVSLiBfBSFhM', 'content': '{"success": true, "task_id": "ca76aa18", "message": "Added task: Design strategy to implement _detect_question method without direct code modification"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Q7Wys8XpG8BgLUUb4AaepJ', 'name': 'git_branch', 'input': {'action': 'create', 'branch_name': 'feature/question-detection-implementation'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Q7Wys8XpG8BgLUUb4AaepJ', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Created and switched to branch \'feature/question-detection-implementation\'", "branch": "feature/question-detection-implementation", "from_branch": null}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01NpntsgNUFZf2qz31ekuzi3', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/question_detection_strategy.md', 'content': '# Question Detection Implementation Strategy\n\n## Context\nImplementation of `_detect_question` method in `AgentRuntime` class for Milestone 3: Question Handling System.\n\n## Objectives\n1. Detect when an agent needs clarification or user input\n2. Generate unique question identifiers\n3. Extract comprehensive question metadata\n4. Support pausing and resuming agent execution\n\n## Proposed Implementation\n\n### Detection Logic\n```python\ndef _detect_question(self, response_data: Dict[str, Any]) -> Optional[Dict[str, Any]]:\n    # Flags for detecting questions\n    needs_clarification = response_data.get(\'needs_clarification\', False)\n    needs_user_input = response_data.get(\'status\') == \'needs_user_input\'\n\n    # No question detected\n    if not (needs_clarification or needs_user_input):\n        return None\n\n    # Extract question text\n    user_question = (\n        response_data.get(\'user_question\') or \n        response_data.get(\'clarification_question\') or \n        "Unspecified clarification needed"\n    )\n\n    # Generate unique question ID\n    question_id = f"q_{self.agent_id}_{str(uuid.uuid4())[:8]}"\n\n    # Comprehensive question metadata\n    question_metadata = {\n        "question_id": question_id,\n        "text": user_question,\n        "type": "clarification" if needs_clarification else "user_input",\n        "options": response_data.get("options", []),\n        "context": {\n            key: value for key, value in response_data.items() \n            if key not in [\'needs_clarification\', \'status\', \'user_question\', \'clarification_question\', \'options\']\n        }\n    }\n\n    return {\n        "needs_clarification": needs_clarification,\n        "needs_user_input": needs_user_input,\n        "question_metadata": question_metadata\n    }\n```\n\n## Integration Considerations\n- Method to be integrated into existing `AgentRuntime.execute()` method\n- Use `activity_tracker` to record question events\n- Support seamless pause and resume of agent execution\n\n## Recommended Next Steps\n1. Code Review\n2. Unit Testing\n3. Integration Testing\n4. Documentation Update\n\n## Potential Challenges\n- Ensuring backwards compatibility\n- Handling various response formats\n- Maintaining performance overhead\n\n## Decision Tracking\n- Strategy approved: [Date]\n- Planned implementation branch: feature/question-detection-implementation'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01NpntsgNUFZf2qz31ekuzi3', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/question_detection_strategy.md", "backup_path": null, "was_overwrite": false}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01LtZFzk9f3gF14DR6BxnNHG', 'name': 'git_commit', 'input': {'message': 'Add question detection implementation strategy documentation', 'files': ['docs/question_detection_strategy.md']}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01LtZFzk9f3gF14DR6BxnNHG', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Changes committed successfully", "commit_hash": "40f6cd5953e30f0fe7c252ab7e2bb1a00afa04da", "files": ["docs/question_detection_strategy.md"], "commit_output": "[feature/task-decomposition-engine 40f6cd5] Add question detection implementation strategy documentation\\n 1 file changed, 72 insertions(+)\\n create mode 100644 docs/question_detection_strategy.md\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\n    "status": "solution_design_in_progress", \n    "project_id": "31930de9", \n    "current_phase": "Milestone 3: Questi