ted item details when needed\n\n**Feature 3: Agent Hierarchy Differentiation**\n- Generate two-word subject summaries for each agent hierarchy\n- Display summary prominently in hierarchy view\n- Summaries should be derived from task/problem description\n- Make hierarchies easily distinguishable at a glance\n\n**Feature 4: Layout Improvements**\n- Enlarge problem description textarea (more height and width)\n- Reduce width of activity feed c'}], 'model': 'claude-3-haiku-20240307', 'system': 'You are a title generator. Generate a concise 5-10 word title that summarizes the main task or goal in the user\'s prompt.\n\nRules:\n- Return ONLY the title, nothing else\n- No quotes, periods, or other punctuation\n- Use action verbs when possible (Build, Create, Fix, Add, Implement)\n- Be specific but brief\n- If the prompt is about code, mention the technology/language if relevant\n\nExamples:\n- "Build user authentication with JWT tokens"\n- "Fix pagination bug in product listing"\n- "Add dark mode toggle to settings page"\n- "Implement real-time chat with WebSockets"\n- "Create REST API for user management"\n'}}"}
